\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Held-out novel-view test |RA| metrics across six ColoRadar scenes. For each scene, mm3DGS trains on the 8 cascaded radar frames adjacent to the held-out test frame ($F\!\pm \!1\!\ldots  \!\pm \!4$, chirp 0 only) and is evaluated on the held-out test frame ($F$, chirp 0). Metrics: Pearson correlation (Corr), peak signal-to-noise ratio (PSNR, dB), structural similarity (SSIM), and root-mean-square error (RMSE) on min-max-normalized 399$\times $399 Cartesian $|\mathrm  {RA}|$ images. Best per-scene \textbf  {bold}.}}{8}{table.2}\protected@file@percent }
