\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Held-out novel-view $|\mathrm  {RA}|$ comparison} on six ColoRadar scenes (columns, sorted by mm3DGS test CC descending). Rows: ground truth (GT), mm3DGS (Ours), RadarSplat, Radar Fields, DART (cascaded). Per-cell test CC overlaid in white. mm3DGS consistently preserves wall and vehicle structure across all scenes; baseline methods exhibit characteristic failure modes --- RadarSplat over-smooths azimuth, Radar Fields smears range bins, and DART smears across range and Doppler.}}{10}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
